---
layout: base.njk
title: Publications
description: Peer-reviewed papers Marc Richardson has co-authored on cloud cost of ML, home network performance and edge computing deployments.
permalink: /publications/
---

<section class="container section narrow">
    <header class="page-header">
        <h1>Publications</h1>
        <p>Peer-reviewed papers from my work on Chameleon Cloud and FLOTO.</p>
    </header>

    <ol class="pub-list">
        {% for pub in publications %}
        <li class="pub-item">
            <div class="pub-year">{{ pub.year }}</div>
            <div>
                <h2 class="pub-title">{% if pub.url %}<a href="{{ pub.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ pub.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ pub.title }}{% endif %}</h2>
                <div class="pub-venue">{{ pub.venue }}</div>
                <p>{{ pub.summary }}</p>
            </div>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ol>

    <h2 class="subhead">Talks and outreach</h2>
    <p>At Chameleon I launched and presented a quarterly webinar series (14+ sessions) and a monthly newsletter that helped users adopt new platform features, including its AI capabilities.</p>
</section>
